PHASE 8 — Embeddings

This is one of the most important topics for GenAI interviews.

Understand exactly:

What is an embedding?

An embedding converts text into a numerical vector representing its semantic meaning.

Example:
"How can I apply for a personal loan?"
                    ↓
             Embedding Model
                    ↓
[0.12, -0.43, 0.78, ...]

Learn:

Embedding models
Dense vectors
Dimensions
Semantic similarity
Cosine similarity
Euclidean distance
Dot product
VERY IMPORTANT INTERVIEW QUESTION

How is a query embedding compared with document embeddings?

Understand:
User Query
     ↓
Query Embedding
     ↓
Vector Search
     ↓
Compare with document vectors
     ↓
Similarity score
     ↓
Top-K documents

Usually this involves similarity measures such as:
Cosine similarity
Dot product
Euclidean distance
